# CLI

CLI wrapper for scripts to quickly get actions done without launching the entire TUI. 

## How to Use

| Command | Action | Arguments | 
|:------:|---------|-----------|
| build | Uses your config file to train, dump your ML model, compiles all dependencies as well | none |
| env | Update `.env` if settings were changed, starts `venv` if not already started | none |
| mlapi | Starts ML API Server using the config model of your choice (assuming its trained already) | none |
| test | Runs tests for `Python` and `Go` source code | none |
| train | Trains a ML model based on a file configuration | none |  

## Future implementation

| Command | Action | Arguments | 
|:------:|---------|-----------|
| build | Uses your config file to train, dump your ML model, compiles all dependencies as well | <config_file> |
| env | Update `.env` if settings were changed, starts `venv` if not already started | none |
| mlapi | Starts ML API Server using the config model of your choice (assuming its trained already) | <config_file> |
| test | Runs tests for `Python` and `Go` source code | none |
| train | Trains a ML model based on a file configuration | <config_file> |  